{"sections":[{"slug":"部分映射","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"部分映射"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">部分映射</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"部分映射"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">部分映射是定义在子集上的映射</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">或者可理解为某些地方的取值为</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">未定义</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的映射</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在计算机科学中</span>, “<span lang=\"zh\">未定义</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">可用于描述输入数据格式有误或程序不停机等现象</span>.</p>\n"}}}]}